### Saúde da API (pública)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/health

### Sem token: deve responder 401
POST http://localhost:3000/api/doadores
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nome": "Teste sem token" }

### Login com senha errada: deve responder 401
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "voluntario@exemplo.com", "senha": "errada" }

### Login correto: guarda o token na variável "login"
# @name login
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "voluntario@exemplo.com", "senha": "conectadoa123" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Com token: deve responder 200
GET http://localhost:3000/api/doadores
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Com token: deve responder 201
POST http://localhost:3000/api/doadores
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nome": "Doador do teste", "email": "teste@exemplo.com" }
